@startuml 3.2.3
actor Operator as Op
participant "MES UI" as UI
participant "MES API" as API
database "MES DB" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Cache Worker" as Worker
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache

== Изменение статуса оператором ==
Op -> UI: POST /orders/12345/status\nMANUFACTURING_STARTED
UI -> API: POST /api/orders/12345/status\nMANUFACTURING_STARTED

API -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status='MANUFACTURING_STARTED'\nWHERE id=12345
DB --> API: OK

API -> MQ: publish order_status_changed\n{order_id=12345,\nstatus_from=PRICE_CALCULATED,\nstatus_to=MANUFACTURING_STARTED}
MQ --> API: ACK

API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Op: Статус обновлён

== Асинхронная инвалидация кеша ==
MQ -> Worker: order_status_changed\n{order_id=12345,...}
Worker -> Cache: DEL orders:PRICE_CALCULATED:*
Worker -> Cache: DEL orders:MANUFACTURING_STARTED:*
Worker -> Cache: DEL orders:new:*
Worker --> MQ: ACK

@enduml
